  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In-New Zealand Tertiary Scholar Conference 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider fy b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;The Manaaki New Zealand Tertiary Scholar conference will be held in May 2024. Up to 660 tertiary scholars will come together for the purpose of networking and professional development.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider fy b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;This activity aims to progress the scholarship programme outcomes of:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider fy b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;- improving scholar to scholar connections&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider fy b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;- building affinity with New Zealand and its people &lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider fy b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;- enriching scholars&apos; learning &lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span cla</narrative>
